These are some old configuration files I used to use back in my Developer and SysAdmin days. 
Nowadays, the terminals are better and the GUIs don't need all the fine tuning that XFree86/XOrg 
required. I put them here for your viewing pleasure and to clear up my dotfiles/ repo for the 
things I actually still use.
